                                        "entry_id": "3b929035-8084-3c90-87dd-ba16b4d3199b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of having complete legal control of something; possession; proprietorship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bf94e31-d13f-4b42-8bc8-4f493569ab78",
                                                "sense_id": "8f88a8d4-8b71-31ee-bc0b-7250263b0557",
                                                "text": "Other evidence of former ownerships such as notice-boards, number plates, and makers' plates, are often discovered unexpectedly. […] It has not been used for many years, and although it was impracticable to photograph the engine in the small confines of the shed it was possible to obtain a picture of the plate which it still carries showing the former ownership."
